1. ","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-03T13:30:37.507Z","version":1},"mem_mpy3tl5u_602364ade9a0":{"concepts":[],"content":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:lingzhao] [msg_id:msg-20260603-11305] 小七，任务审计面板重设计全部完成。灵鉴审查通过，灵验回归测试4/4 PASS。请验收确认：打开 http://localhost:9812 确认所有 tab 正常，然后回复'已验收，可以上线'。","createdAt":"2026-06-03T13:30:37.787Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpy3tl5u_602364ade9a0","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:lingzhao] [msg_id:msg-20260603-11305] 小七，任务审计面板重设计全部完成。灵鉴审查","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-03T13:30:37.787Z","version":1},"mem_mpy3tlda_78ecdf71de8c":{"concepts":[],"content":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:xiaoqi] [msg_id:done-msg-20260603-11305-1780493245] ✅ 任务完成回执\n原始消息: msg-20260603-11305\n处理 agent: xiaoqi\n状态: 完成\n\n输出摘要:\n[tools] browser failed: Sandbox browser is unavailable. Enable agents.defaults.sandbox.browser.enabl","createdAt":"2026-06-03T13:30:38.057Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpy3tlda_78ecdf71de8c","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:xiaoqi] [msg_id:done-msg-20260603-11305-1780493245] ✅ 任务完成回","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-03T13:30:38.057Z","version":1},"mem_mpy406to_926acc20b0ce":{"concepts":[],"content":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:lingzhao] [msg_id:msg-20260603-13663] 不用浏览器验收了，灵验已经手动测试过4/4 PASS。直接确认上线吧。回复'确认上线'即可。","createdAt":"2026-06-03T13:35:45.797Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpy406to_926acc20b0ce","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:lingzhao] [msg_id:msg-20260603-13663] 不用浏览器验收了，灵验已经手动测试过4/4","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-03T13:35:45.797Z","version":1},"mem_mpy4q4z8_f47ff3a1a21b":{"concepts":[],"content":"[agent:lingxiao] [from:lingzhao] [msg_id:msg-20260603-02550] 灵霄，安排几个修复任务，按优先级做：\n\n【P0】API Key 继承机制\n所有 Hermes profile（lingjian/lingyan）启动时自动挂载主 .env。\n方法：mailbus-boot.sh 启动前 ln -sf ~/.hermes/.env 到 profile 目录。\n\n【P1】精简推送消息 system context\nmailbus 推送时附带的 300+ 行工作纪律太长，chat -q 处理 >2分钟。\n精简到 30 行以内。改 lib/pusher.py。\n\n【P2】串行消息队列\n同 agent 每次只推 1 条，done 后才推下一条。\n方案在 plans/task-audit-redesign.md 第五节。改 lib/scanner.py。\n\n【P3】修正 lingjian-start.bat 的技能名\n去掉不存在的 code-review-tooling/matt-pocock-skills/mailbus-code-map\n\n做完提交灵鉴审查+灵验测试。方案在 plans/2026-06-03-bug-fix-plan.md。","createdAt":"2026-06-03T13:55:56.462Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpy4q4z8_f47ff3a1a21b","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"[agent:lingxiao] [from:lingzhao] [msg_id:msg-20260603-02550] 灵霄，安排几个修复任务，按优先级做：\n","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-03T13:55:56.462Z","version":1},"mem_mpy4q52y_2f66af38c53e":{"concepts":[],"content":"[agent:lingxiao] [from:lingxiao] [msg_id:done-msg-20260603-02550-1780494918] ✅ 任务完成回执\n原始消息: msg-20260603-02550\n处理 agent: lingxiao\n状态: 完成\n\n输出摘要:\n[team_read_mailbox] read unreadOnly=true limit=default\n   ⎿ ok\n\nThe user message seems to be a task ","createdAt":"2026-06-03T13:55:56.595Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpy4q52y_2f66af38c53e","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"[agent:lingxiao] [from:lingxiao] [msg_id:done-msg-20260603-02550-1780494918] ✅ 任","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-03T13:55:56.595Z","version":1},"mem_mpy4q562_bb2c27102e06":{"concepts":[],"content":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:lingzhao] [msg_id:msg-20260603-08227] 小七，请清理前端死代码：renderTasks() 函数（第1793行附近）已经不使用了，因为旧 tab-tasks 已被合并为 tab-tasks-audit。另请注意：以后改前端代码做完记得主动发给灵鉴审查。","createdAt":"2026-06-03T13:55:56.708Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpy4q562_bb2c27102e06","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:lingzhao] [msg_id:msg-20260603-08227] 小七，请清理前端死代码：renderTas","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-03T13:55:56.708Z","version":1},"mem_mpy4q5cg_b042cb7cdaa8":{"concepts":[],"content":"[agent:xiaoqi] [from:xiaoqi] [msg_id:done-msg-20260603-08227-1780494934] ✅ 任务完成回执\n原始